+# Finn visual presence — owner acceptance candidate
+Baseline: e64c0297ec72a880db773faab3bdd434191a35af.
+Shared avatar sizes increased; Home uses responsive hero with larger spacing; short mobile viewports use compact overrides so both actions remain above footer. Header logo remains 36px. No artwork, scanner recognition, recommendations, voice generation or monetization changes.
+Latest TypeScript passed. Browser checks passed at 320x568, 390x844 and 1280x800 in Free, including Home actions above footer, Profile, Surprise Me and empty state. Hero widths approximately 131,253,272px respectively. Premium small-screen Home passed with no ad. Prior test failure identified footer overlap at 320x568, fixed. One development-server reload interrupted a rerun. Banner acceptance script now waits for Premium footer attachment rather than visibility. Final visual owner acceptance, real device testing and full integrated regression/build/CI remain outstanding. Three-game recommendation standard and voice production are separate deferred workstreams.
